direction: right
title: Databricks Instance Pools Warm-Start

WithoutPool: Cold Boot Lag (5-7 Mins) {
  style.stroke: "#EF4444"
  Trigger: 1. Job Triggered
  CloudVM: 2. Cloud VM Allocation (4 mins)
  DBRDownload: 3. DBR 10GB Container Pull (3 mins)
  Run: 4. Total Wait: 7 Minutes!

  Trigger -> CloudVM -> DBRDownload -> Run
}

WithPool: Instance Pool Warm Start (<30s) {
  style.stroke: "#34D399"
  Pool: Pre-Warmed VM Pool (Zero DBU while idle)
  JobAttach: Instant VM Attachment (<30s)
  Execute: Immediate Execution

  Pool -> JobAttach -> Execute
}
